  "version": 2,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| tenant | may call | limit | heavy pool |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **compliance** | `eth_*`, `net_*`, `web3_*` | 200 requests / 10 s | no |\n| **forensics** | the above plus `debug_*`, `trace_*` | 50 requests / 10 s | yes, one request in flight per key |\n| **prober** | everything, internal SLI probes | none | yes |\n\n`admin_*`, `personal_*`, `miner_*`, `txpool_*` are refused for everyone. No key: 401. Wrong tier or refused method: 403. Over the limit: 429 with Retry-After. Keys live in `devnet/.env` (`GATEWAY_KEY_*`)."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "compliance",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "description": "Reads only, 200 per 10 s. A 403 here is a compliance client trying a trace.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/^200/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
